(6608661, 986532, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot with a colorful sunset. I think the shot is lacking a little in luminosity. For a sunset it just doesn''t glow with light. But you got all the tones in there!</td>', 'Lovely shot with a colorful sunset. I think the shot is lacking a little in luminosity. For a sunset it just doesn''t glow with light. But you got all the tones in there!', '2011-12-02 10:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608666, 985556, 10785, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, this shot leads me right away from the tree due to the leading line of the canal and the fact the tree is in the left third and bending to the left. The bend acts like an arrowhead pointing to the water which leads me to the right edge of the photo. You have great color and exposure and a wide range of light.</td>', 'Compositionally, this shot leads me right away from the tree due to the leading line of the canal and the fact the tree is in the left third and bending to the left. The bend acts like an arrowhead pointing to the water which leads me to the right edge of the photo. You have great color and exposure and a wide range of light.', '2011-12-02 10:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608674, 986530, 10785, '<td valign="top">Local editing on the foreground (Brightening) has offset it too much from the background and given the lighting an unnatural look and feel. Otherwise great texture and light on the subject. Too dark and grey in the background.</td>', 'Local editing on the foreground (Brightening) has offset it too much from the background and given the lighting an unnatural look and feel. Otherwise great texture and light on the subject. Too dark and grey in the background.', '2011-12-02 10:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
