(6608916, 986538, 10785, '<td valign="top">This definitely needs a person to put it over the top. It is well exposed with a good composition. But a person unwinding would have pumped it up yby proviiding a nice pop of color and added interest IMHO.</td>', 'This definitely needs a person to put it over the top. It is well exposed with a good composition. But a person unwinding would have pumped it up yby proviiding a nice pop of color and added interest IMHO.', '2011-12-02 14:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
