(6608922, 986213, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice range of tones and great exposure throughout... HDR??? Good movement in the coulds too! The dark shapes of the trees are standing guard along the line of the path leading you through the gates of what I presume to be a cemetary.</td>', 'Nice range of tones and great exposure throughout... HDR??? Good movement in the coulds too! The dark shapes of the trees are standing guard along the line of the path leading you through the gates of what I presume to be a cemetary.', '2011-12-02 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
