(6609433, 986452, 67152, '<td valign="top">expansive</td>', 'expansive', '2011-12-03 07:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609434, 986524, 67152, '<td valign="top">so delicate</td>', 'so delicate', '2011-12-03 07:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609435, 986193, 67152, '<td valign="top">the feel of the image is great but in this case I think the border overwhelms</td>', 'the feel of the image is great but in this case I think the border overwhelms', '2011-12-03 07:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609437, 985646, 114285, '<td valign="top">Not really thrilled with the crop, I think the crop should of included some of the ground, but then again you possibly took this out of a moving car, how do I know. I do like the sky.</td>', 'Not really thrilled with the crop, I think the crop should of included some of the ground, but then again you possibly took this out of a moving car, how do I know. I do like the sky.', '2011-12-03 07:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609438, 986546, 114285, '<td valign="top">A tad on the over processed side, shame as this had real potential the tree is amazing, good find.</td>', 'A tad on the over processed side, shame as this had real potential the tree is amazing, good find.', '2011-12-03 08:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609440, 985966, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, and I love the people at the end.</td>', 'Wonderful, and I love the people at the end.', '2011-12-03 08:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609455, 986538, 94241, '<td valign="top">I like this.  One suggestion: I think the dead-centered subject feels a little stiff and formal for an image that''s about being relaxed.  Perhaps an off-centered crop (with wider aspect-ratio)?</td>', 'I like this.  One suggestion: I think the dead-centered subject feels a little stiff and formal for an image that''s about being relaxed.  Perhaps an off-centered crop (with wider aspect-ratio)?', '2011-12-03 08:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609457, 986512, 94241, '<td valign="top">Zen-like.<br/> <br/>I feel the point of view is a little high.  The top of the trees are at most even with eye-level, making them seem diminished and unimportant.  I kind of wish I could see this from a little closer to the ground, I think it would have a bit more drama.</td>', 'Zen-like. I feel the point of view is a little high.  The top of the trees are at most even with eye-level, making them seem diminished and unimportant.  I kind of wish I could see this from a little closer to the ground, I think it would have a bit more drama.', '2011-12-03 08:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609458, 985808, 94241, '<td valign="top">The glowing halo around each tree is disturbing.</td>', 'The glowing halo around each tree is disturbing.', '2011-12-03 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609459, 986447, 94241, '<td valign="top">An image can usually have one hero, and the hero of this is the waterfall.  The branch is too far out of frame and diminished to really be noticed.</td>', 'An image can usually have one hero, and the hero of this is the waterfall.  The branch is too far out of frame and diminished to really be noticed.', '2011-12-03 08:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609460, 986214, 94241, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea, I love it.  Just needs more oomph.  Perhaps a super long exposure at the tiniest aperture so each light turns into a little starburst?</td>', 'Brilliant idea, I love it.  Just needs more oomph.  Perhaps a super long exposure at the tiniest aperture so each light turns into a little starburst?', '2011-12-03 08:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609462, 985602, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  :)<br/> <br/>I feel the crop is a little tall.  I wish just about a half an inch were shaved off the top.</td>', 'Beautiful.  :) I feel the crop is a little tall.  I wish just about a half an inch were shaved off the top.', '2011-12-03 08:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609464, 986277, 94241, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I love abstract patterns like this.  :D<br/> <br/>I think it needs a little bit more movement to the picture.  The pattern draws the eye down and to the left.  I understand you went for flatness in tones, but I think it''s a bit too flat.  A few gradient brightness adjustments to darken the other three corners (especially the bottom-right) would help emphasize the eye movement.</td>', 'Excellent!  I love abstract patterns like this.  :D I think it needs a little bit more movement to the picture.  The pattern draws the eye down and to the left.  I understand you went for flatness in tones, but I think it''s a bit too flat.  A few gradient brightness adjustments to darken the other three corners (especially the bottom-right) would help emphasize the eye movement.', '2011-12-03 09:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609465, 986073, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  :)<br/> <br/>Needs a kick light behind the tree on camera-left to help separate out that top edge from the back wall.</td>', 'Beautiful.  :) Needs a kick light behind the tree on camera-left to help separate out that top edge from the back wall.', '2011-12-03 09:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609467, 985873, 94241, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I think this has too much detail for an 800px wide image.  Gorgeous colors though.  :)</td>', 'Hmm, I think this has too much detail for an 800px wide image.  Gorgeous colors though.  :)', '2011-12-03 09:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609468, 986494, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I love this.  :)<br/> <br/>I''d suggest a bit more brightness along the path, leading around the corner.</td>', 'Beautiful, I love this.  :) I''d suggest a bit more brightness along the path, leading around the corner.', '2011-12-03 09:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609473, 985646, 94241, '<td valign="top">I feel I''d like to see the trees turned into pure silhouettes -- just bumping up the black clip point a little bit would do it.</td>', 'I feel I''d like to see the trees turned into pure silhouettes -- just bumping up the black clip point a little bit would do it.', '2011-12-03 09:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609475, 986524, 94241, '<td valign="top">Feels a touch off balance, heavy on the left.</td>', 'Feels a touch off balance, heavy on the left.', '2011-12-03 09:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609480, 986529, 94241, '<td valign="top">The tree is too subtle, I''m sorry.  The reflection, maybe the building, is the hero and subject of this image.  The trees seem kinda not the point.</td>', 'The tree is too subtle, I''m sorry.  The reflection, maybe the building, is the hero and subject of this image.  The trees seem kinda not the point.', '2011-12-03 09:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609481, 986495, 94241, '<td valign="top">Perspective distortion is a little weird here -- makes the tree bulge in the center.  Perhaps a longer lens from farther back?</td>', 'Perspective distortion is a little weird here -- makes the tree bulge in the center.  Perhaps a longer lens from farther back?', '2011-12-03 09:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609483, 985556, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I especially love the painterly feel.<br/> <br/>Seems rather unbalanced though.  The tree is kind of arcing out of frame instead of into it, carrying my eye with it.<br/> <br/>I wish I could see this scene from a few footsteps to the left -- just to where the tree curls over the canal and cradles it.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I especially love the painterly feel. Seems rather unbalanced though.  The tree is kind of arcing out of frame instead of into it, carrying my eye with it. I wish I could see this scene from a few footsteps to the left -- just to where the tree curls over the canal and cradles it.', '2011-12-03 09:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609484, 986403, 94241, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I kinda like it, but it feels like two different images.  The sky, water, and stones feel like one photo, the trees like another.  Style-wise, they don''t really seem to have much to do with each other.</td>', 'Hmm, I kinda like it, but it feels like two different images.  The sky, water, and stones feel like one photo, the trees like another.  Style-wise, they don''t really seem to have much to do with each other.', '2011-12-03 09:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609486, 986245, 94241, '<td valign="top">Too small.  I understand this is probably meant to be seen across a large print or wide monitor.  But on DPC with 800px limit, it just makes this kind of feel like a thumbnail.</td>', 'Too small.  I understand this is probably meant to be seen across a large print or wide monitor.  But on DPC with 800px limit, it just makes this kind of feel like a thumbnail.', '2011-12-03 09:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609489, 986496, 94241, '<td valign="top">Clever!  I like.  Good lightning and colors too.  :D<br/> <br/>A little bit of lens distortion is bugging me though.  It''s the angle of the pillars in the lower-left, it makes it feel like the building is melting.</td>', 'Clever!  I like.  Good lightning and colors too.  :D A little bit of lens distortion is bugging me though.  It''s the angle of the pillars in the lower-left, it makes it feel like the building is melting.', '2011-12-03 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609491, 985785, 94241, '<td valign="top">Nice glare effect.  :D</td>', 'Nice glare effect.  :D', '2011-12-03 09:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609494, 985897, 94241, '<td valign="top">The smudge in the lowest-right distracts.  Otherwise, beautiful.  :D</td>', 'The smudge in the lowest-right distracts.  Otherwise, beautiful.  :D', '2011-12-03 09:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609495, 986238, 94241, '<td valign="top">Ah man, beautiful.  I''d love to see this as an HDR.  Not for more detail in darks, I love the shadows you''ve got going.  But I''d want just a little less burn-out in the rift in the sky.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I''m picking nits.  It''s a gorgeous shot.</td>', 'Ah man, beautiful.  I''d love to see this as an HDR.  Not for more detail in darks, I love the shadows you''ve got going.  But I''d want just a little less burn-out in the rift in the sky. Anyway, I''m picking nits.  It''s a gorgeous shot.', '2011-12-03 09:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609594, 985556, 116574, '<td valign="top">A slightly different crop with less on the top might have worked better for me.  I really like your shot but think that the foreground is a bit over saturated and out of balance with the background.  I do love the processing on the tree though.  6</td>', 'A slightly different crop with less on the top might have worked better for me.  I really like your shot but think that the foreground is a bit over saturated and out of balance with the background.  I do love the processing on the tree though.  6', '2011-12-03 12:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609596, 986553, 116574, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit flat for my taste and dull but like the composition.</td>', 'It''s a bit flat for my taste and dull but like the composition.', '2011-12-03 12:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609601, 985602, 116574, '<td valign="top">Love your shot.  The colors are great.</td>', 'Love your shot.  The colors are great.', '2011-12-03 12:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
