(6615132, 986524, 104230, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> If you flip it vertically to the right, it looks like a giant tree :-)  Nice finish, Penny! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, Johanna.  After I''d submitted this I wished I''d at least considered a horizontal flip, so that the "arrow" direction was L to R rather than R to L.  Horizontal flips are something I usually consider during processing but in the rush to get this in I didn''t even think of it!</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: If you flip it vertically to the right, it looks like a giant tree :-)  Nice finish, Penny!   Thanks, Johanna.  After I''d submitted this I wished I''d at least considered a horizontal flip, so that the "arrow" direction was L to R rather than R to L.  Horizontal flips are something I usually consider during processing but in the rush to get this in I didn''t even think of it!', '2011-12-09 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 0),
