(6619130, 985732, 47470, '<td valign="top">You asked for some additional feedback, so I''ll leave it here : )<br/> <br/>I think the image would have been stronger on its own without the vignette.  I can''t really put my finger on why, but using a heavy vignette like that seems...amateurish.  I know that''s a strong word, but I don''t mean for it to sound too harsh.  A light vignette that almost blends in with the image might have complimented the scene and helped keep the focus on the tree, but I just think the vignette is too overpowering.<br/> <br/>I like the fence in the foreground.  I think it adds depth.  I think I would have also liked a bit more fine sharpening to pull out the detail in the grass.</td>', 'You asked for some additional feedback, so I''ll leave it here : ) I think the image would have been stronger on its own without the vignette.  I can''t really put my finger on why, but using a heavy vignette like that seems...amateurish.  I know that''s a strong word, but I don''t mean for it to sound too harsh.  A light vignette that almost blends in with the image might have complimented the scene and helped keep the focus on the tree, but I just think the vignette is too overpowering. I like the fence in the foreground.  I think it adds depth.  I think I would have also liked a bit more fine sharpening to pull out the detail in the grass.', '2011-12-15 18:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
